' 4+1 process view - Owner cancels with a reason (US12) · and a player's cancellation at the same time
' Version 1.1 - 2026-11-10
' For: whoever writes code and whoever debugs.
' Documented decision: The owner cancels with a reason, with no window, and the email goes in the same transaction (US12).
' Not drawn: internal detail of the classes; refusals that do not change the sequence (they are in the text of process.md).
@startuml process-cancel-club
!include ../style.puml

title Process view - owner cancels with a reason (US12), and a player's cancellation at the same time
autonumber

participant "Calendar" as WEB_F_CALENDAR
box "ASP.NET Core API"
  participant "Owner bookings" as API_CLUBBOOK
  participant "Per-owner authorization" as CC_AUTHZ
  participant "Pitch lock" as CC_LOCK
  participant "Put in the outbox" as API_NOTIF_OUTBOX
  participant "Cancel (player)" as API_BOOK_MINE
end box
database "PostgreSQL" as C_DB

WEB_F_CALENDAR -> API_CLUBBOOK : POST /api/manage/clubs/{clubId}/bookings/{bookingId}/cancel {\nreason } [apiJson; Owner policy]
API_CLUBBOOK -> CC_AUTHZ : Does the club belong to the session's owner? (404 club_not_found)
API_CLUBBOOK -> CC_AUTHZ : the booking's pitch_id, only inside this club (404\nbooking_not_found)
CC_AUTHZ -> C_DB : Filters by clubs.owner_id = session [SELECT]
API_CLUBBOOK -> API_CLUBBOOK : Validates reason: required, trimmed, ≤ 200 (400)
group Lock transaction
  API_CLUBBOOK -> CC_LOCK : LockAsync(pitchId)
  CC_LOCK -> C_DB : BEGIN; SELECT 1 FROM pitches … FOR UPDATE [SQL]
  API_CLUBBOOK -> C_DB : Reads the booking again [SELECT bookings]
  API_CLUBBOOK -> API_CLUBBOOK : booking.CancelByClub(reason, now) → ClubCancellationOutcome (no\nwindow)
  alt NotConfirmed
    API_CLUBBOOK --> WEB_F_CALENDAR : 422 booking_not_confirmed
  else AlreadyStarted (startsAt ≤ now)
    API_CLUBBOOK --> WEB_F_CALENDAR : 422 booking_already_started
  else Cancelled
    API_CLUBBOOK -> API_NOTIF_OUTBOX : EnqueueClubCancellationAsync (nothing for a customer without an account)
    API_CLUBBOOK -> C_DB : SaveChanges: UPDATE bookings (CancelledByClub,\ncancellation_reason, cancelled_at) and INSERT outbox_messages\n[SQL]
    CC_LOCK -> C_DB : COMMIT [SQL]
    API_CLUBBOOK --> WEB_F_CALENDAR : 200 ClubBookingResponse
  end
end

== Owner and player cancel the same booking at the same time ==

API_CLUBBOOK -> CC_LOCK : Owner: LockAsync(pitchId)
API_BOOK_MINE -> CC_LOCK : Player: LockAsync(pitchId), the same lock
CC_LOCK -> C_DB : Whoever reaches FOR UPDATE first cancels and COMMITs; the other\nwaits [SQL]
API_BOOK_MINE -> C_DB : The second one reads the booking again: it is no longer Confirmed [SELECT\nbookings]
API_CLUBBOOK --> WEB_F_CALENDAR : One of the two: 422 booking_not_confirmed; the booking has a single\nfinal state and a single email
@enduml
